{
  "title": "API Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "클라이언트의 API 요청을 받아 인증과 전달을 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#guide-1\">요청을 처리할 API 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#guide-2\">접근과 운영 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>03 / 62</span></div><h1>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Gateway</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>API Gateway는 <strong>애플리케이션의 API<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 외부나 내부 사용자에게 제공하는 관리형 진입점</strong>입니다. 요청을 받아 인증과 사용량 제어 등을 적용하고 Lambda나 HTTP 서버로 전달합니다.</p><p>서버를 직접 만들지 않고 API를 제공하거나, 여러 처리 대상 앞에서 공통 접근 규칙을 관리할 때 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"rest-apis\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"http-apis\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"websocket-apis\"></span><h2>요청을 처리할 API 구성</h2><p>HTTP 기반 API는 경로와 메서드를 정의하고 처리 대상을 연결합니다. Lambda와 연결하면 요청 처리 코드를 함수로 실행할 수 있으며, HTTP 서버나 지원 AWS 서비스와의 통합도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>REST API와 HTTP API는 지원 기능과 비용이 다릅니다. 필요한 인증, 캐시, 사용 계획 등의 기능을 기준으로 선택합니다. 지속적인 양방향 연결에는 WebSocket API를 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"integrations-and-vpc-links\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"authorizers-and-iam-authorization\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"throttling-usage-plans-and-caching\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"stages-deployments-and-custom-domains\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cors-logging-and-errors\"></span><h2>접근과 운영 관리</h2><p>JWT, IAM 또는 Lambda 기반 권한 확인 등 API 유형에서 지원하는 인증 방식을 적용합니다. API 키는 사용량 식별 용도와 사용자 인증을 구분해 사용합니다.</p><p>요청 제한과 로그를 설정해 과부하와 오류를 관찰합니다. 배포 단계별 설정과 사용자 지정 도메인을 관리하고, 브라우저에서 호출한다면 CORS 설정도 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>API 요청의 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>클라이언트</strong><span>경로·메서드로 요청</span></li><li><strong>API Gateway</strong><span>인증·제한·전달</span></li><li><strong>처리 대상</strong><span>Lambda 또는 HTTP 서비스</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">실제 업무 처리는 연결된 코드나 서비스가 수행합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>모바일 앱의 주문 API를 API Gateway로 제공하고 Lambda에 연결합니다. 사용자 토큰을 확인한 요청만 처리하고 호출량과 오류 로그를 모니터링합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>API</strong> — 프로그램이 다른 프로그램에 작업을 요청하거나 데이터를 주고받는 인터페이스입니다. 웹 API에서는 URL과 HTTP 메서드 등으로 요청 내용을 표현합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/apigateway/latest/developerguide/welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon API Gateway? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q071\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q077\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q072\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">이전 용어 <b>AMI</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">다음 용어 <b>Aurora</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
